{"meta":{"title":"QinYin-xcy的博客","subtitle":"","description":"这是一个个人博客","author":"QianYin-xcy","url":"https://www.qianyin-xcy.top","root":"/"},"pages":[],"posts":[{"title":"CAN协议","slug":"CAN","date":"2026-09-03T00:58:49.465Z","updated":"2026-09-03T08:41:37.108Z","comments":true,"path":"2026/09/03/CAN/","permalink":"https://www.qianyin-xcy.top/2026/09/03/CAN/","excerpt":"","text":"","categories":[],"tags":[],"author":"QianYin-xcy"},{"title":"FreeRTOS操作系统","slug":"FreeRTOS","date":"2026-09-03T00:57:51.946Z","updated":"2026-09-03T08:42:02.871Z","comments":true,"path":"2026/09/03/FreeRTOS/","permalink":"https://www.qianyin-xcy.top/2026/09/03/FreeRTOS/","excerpt":"","text":"","categories":[],"tags":[],"author":"QianYin-xcy"},{"title":"单总线协议","slug":"Single_wire","date":"2026-09-03T00:55:58.395Z","updated":"2026-09-03T08:42:26.500Z","comments":true,"path":"2026/09/03/Single_wire/","permalink":"https://www.qianyin-xcy.top/2026/09/03/Single_wire/","excerpt":"","text":"","categories":[],"tags":[],"author":"QianYin-xcy"},{"title":"SPI协议","slug":"SPI","date":"2026-09-03T00:55:38.676Z","updated":"2026-09-03T08:42:40.160Z","comments":true,"path":"2026/09/03/SPI/","permalink":"https://www.qianyin-xcy.top/2026/09/03/SPI/","excerpt":"","text":"","categories":[],"tags":[],"author":"QianYin-xcy"},{"title":"IIC协议","slug":"IIC","date":"2026-09-03T00:54:38.208Z","updated":"2026-09-03T08:42:13.072Z","comments":true,"path":"2026/09/03/IIC/","permalink":"https://www.qianyin-xcy.top/2026/09/03/IIC/","excerpt":"","text":"","categories":[],"tags":[],"author":"QianYin-xcy"},{"title":"C语言错题","slug":"C_launguage_wrong answer","date":"2026-09-03T00:49:47.616Z","updated":"2026-09-03T08:59:04.972Z","comments":true,"path":"2026/09/03/C_launguage_wrong answer/","permalink":"https://www.qianyin-xcy.top/2026/09/03/C_launguage_wrong%20answer/","excerpt":"","text":"1、设有以下语句： 12char a = 3, b = 6, c;c = a ^ b &lt;&lt; 2; 则 c 的二进制值是 ______。我的错误答案：0100（即十进制 4）运算符优先级混淆：误认为 ^（按位异或）优先级高于 &lt;&lt;（左移），于是先计算 a ^ b，再左移 2 位。 2、根据以下定义，错误的表达式是 1struct &#123;int a; char b;&#125; Q, *p=&amp;Q; A、Q.a B、(*p).b C、p-&gt;a D、*p.b 3、分析以下代码的运算结果： 1234567struct node&#123; int a; int b; int c;&#125;;struct node s=&#123;3,5,6&#125;;struct node *pt=&amp;s;printf(&quot;%d\\n&quot;, *(int *)pt); 我的错误答案：6 正确答案：3错误原因：误以为指针 pt 指向结构体的末尾或最后一个成员 c，实际上 pt 指向的是结构体变量 s 的首地址。 正确解析：结构体在内存中是连续分布的，其第一个成员 a 就位于结构体的起始地址。(int *)pt 将结构体指针强转为整型指针后，解引用 *(int *)pt 读取的正是从首地址开始的 int 类型数据，也就是第一个成员 a 的值（3）。 4、用C语言编程实现对数组 a[10]&#x3D;{6,2,8,11,0,7,3,-3,9,12} 的升序排列。我的错误答案：不会写正确答案：（采用最基础的冒泡排序法） 1234567891011121314151617181920212223#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;int main() &#123; int a[10] = &#123;6, 2, 8, 11, 0, 7, 3, -3, 9, 12&#125;; int i, j, temp; // 冒泡排序：每次将最大的数沉底 for(i = 0; i &lt; 9; i++) &#123; // 外层循环控制比较轮数，10个数只需比较9轮 for(j = 0; j &lt; 9 - i; j++) &#123; // 内层循环控制每轮两两比较的次数 if(a[j] &gt; a[j+1]) &#123; // 如果前一个数大于后一个数，则交换位置 temp = a[j]; a[j] = a[j+1]; a[j+1] = temp; &#125; &#125; &#125; // 打印排序后的数组 for(i = 0; i &lt; 10; i++) &#123; printf(&quot;%d &quot;, a[i]); &#125; return 0;&#125; 错误原因：对数组排序算法（如冒泡排序、选择排序等）的嵌套循环逻辑不熟练，不知道该怎样通过双重循环实现元素比较和位置交换。正确解析：冒泡排序的核心思想是“两两比较相邻元素，如果反序则交换”，通过双重循环不断将最大值（或最小值）像气泡一样冒到数组末端。","categories":[{"name":"笔记","slug":"笔记","permalink":"https://www.qianyin-xcy.top/categories/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/"}],"tags":[{"name":"C语言错题","slug":"C语言错题","permalink":"https://www.qianyin-xcy.top/tags/C%E8%AF%AD%E8%A8%80%E9%94%99%E9%A2%98/"}],"author":"QianYin-xcy"},{"title":"linux常见命令","slug":"Common_Linux_commands","date":"2026-09-02T02:53:53.388Z","updated":"2026-09-03T08:41:49.699Z","comments":true,"path":"2026/09/02/Common_Linux_commands/","permalink":"https://www.qianyin-xcy.top/2026/09/02/Common_Linux_commands/","excerpt":"","text":"在Linux终端下工作，掌握常用命令是基本技能。","categories":[{"name":"笔记","slug":"笔记","permalink":"https://www.qianyin-xcy.top/categories/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/"}],"tags":[{"name":"Linux","slug":"Linux","permalink":"https://www.qianyin-xcy.top/tags/Linux/"},{"name":"命令","slug":"命令","permalink":"https://www.qianyin-xcy.top/tags/%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4/"}],"author":"QianYin-xcy"},{"title":"github搭建博客（volantis主题）","slug":"GitHub_Blog_Setup","date":"2026-09-01T10:26:36.263Z","updated":"2026-09-03T08:40:33.826Z","comments":true,"path":"2026/09/01/GitHub_Blog_Setup/","permalink":"https://www.qianyin-xcy.top/2026/09/01/GitHub_Blog_Setup/","excerpt":"","text":"这篇文章记录了从零搭建个人博客的完整教程，包括环境配置、主题安装、个性化设置和部署上线。","categories":[{"name":"博客搭建","slug":"博客搭建","permalink":"https://www.qianyin-xcy.top/categories/%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA/"}],"tags":[{"name":"GitHub Pages","slug":"GitHub-Pages","permalink":"https://www.qianyin-xcy.top/tags/GitHub-Pages/"},{"name":"Hexo","slug":"Hexo","permalink":"https://www.qianyin-xcy.top/tags/Hexo/"},{"name":"个人博客","slug":"个人博客","permalink":"https://www.qianyin-xcy.top/tags/%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2/"}],"author":"QianYin-xcy"},{"title":"USART协议","slug":"USART","date":"2026-08-29T10:08:39.805Z","updated":"2026-08-29T10:43:20.054Z","comments":true,"path":"2026/08/29/USART/","permalink":"https://www.qianyin-xcy.top/2026/08/29/USART/","excerpt":"","text":"","categories":[{"name":"笔记","slug":"笔记","permalink":"https://www.qianyin-xcy.top/categories/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/"}],"tags":[{"name":"USART","slug":"USART","permalink":"https://www.qianyin-xcy.top/tags/USART/"}],"author":"QianYin-xcy"}],"categories":[{"name":"笔记","slug":"笔记","permalink":"https://www.qianyin-xcy.top/categories/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/"},{"name":"博客搭建","slug":"博客搭建","permalink":"https://www.qianyin-xcy.top/categories/%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA/"}],"tags":[{"name":"C语言错题","slug":"C语言错题","permalink":"https://www.qianyin-xcy.top/tags/C%E8%AF%AD%E8%A8%80%E9%94%99%E9%A2%98/"},{"name":"Linux","slug":"Linux","permalink":"https://www.qianyin-xcy.top/tags/Linux/"},{"name":"命令","slug":"命令","permalink":"https://www.qianyin-xcy.top/tags/%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4/"},{"name":"GitHub Pages","slug":"GitHub-Pages","permalink":"https://www.qianyin-xcy.top/tags/GitHub-Pages/"},{"name":"Hexo","slug